{"title": "Francesca", "pageid": 51162, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Francesca", "categories": ["Druids"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Emerald_Enclave.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Emerald_Enclave.webp/300px-Emerald_Enclave.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Emerald_Enclave.webp/450px-Emerald_Enclave.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Emerald_Enclave.webp/600px-Emerald_Enclave.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Emerald_Enclave.webp/300px-Emerald_Enclave.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Emerald_Enclave.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Symbol of Silvanus</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Francesca</b> an Archdruid is mentioned in Baldur's Gate\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Francesca of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/High_Forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"High Forest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/High_Forest\">High Forest</a></span> becomes the successor of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/25px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/38px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/50px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Halsin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/25px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\">Halsin</a> as Archdruid and leader of the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Letter_from_Francesca\" title=\"Letter from Francesca\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Cra